  "description": "Jeong Yi-an, who has spent his 34 years dating only women, harbours a desire to sleep with a man just once. Then, at a high school reunion he attended by chance, he meets Kim Su-hyuk. However, sleeping with him wasn’t as thrilling as Yi-an had imagined. Just as he was about to dismiss it as a one-night fling, Su-hyeok unexpectedly got in touch first. Clearly, at first, it had been nothing more than a new thrill in his monotonous daily life. Yet, as his meetings with Su-hyeok continued, laughter, joy and a tingling sense of excitement began to accompany them, and the bond between them—which had spanned sixteen years—began to take on a slightly different form……\nSource: MU",
